        <p>
          <img title="3 .gif" src="data:image/gif;base64," alt="" width="397" height="163" />
        </p>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" xlink:from="HH95A6DE2A459B887F81CD55739AE3D97C" xlink:to="HH539CA9D277015636ED6E3D4216C1FD1A" order="1" />
    <link:loc xlink:type="locator" xlink:href="#HH0258AE4883BFCA77F243D2DA387A6B17" xlink:label="HH0258AE4883BFCA77F243D2DA387A6B17" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="HH8B9BCCA9A7D9719D432CC6E7D87A372A" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <p>
          <strong>Schedule Page: 278 Line No.: 3 Column: a&#160; </strong>
        </p>
        <p>Pursuant to Section 22.3 (c) of the General Terms and Conditions of Sea Robin's FERC Gas Tariff, Third Revised Volume No. 1, Docket No. RP25-318-000, as approved by FERC&#8217;s order issued on January 23, 2025, and Docket No. RP26-302-000, as approved by FERC&#8217;s order issued on January 23, 2026.</p>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" xlink:from="HH0258AE4883BFCA77F243D2DA387A6B17" xlink:to="HH8B9BCCA9A7D9719D432CC6E7D87A372A" order="1" />
    <link:loc xlink:type="locator" xlink:href="#HH24A669400D6EEA45118DBD5CCB8CD8F3" xlink:label="HH24A669400D6EEA45118DBD5CCB8CD8F3" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="HHE60424AE5533C1C52CCFDEB2BC0A76BF" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <p>
          <strong>Schedule Page: 278 Line No.: 2 Column: f</strong>
        </p>
        <p>Loss on ARO restricted investment.</p>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" xlink:from="HH24A669400D6EEA45118DBD5CCB8CD8F3" xlink:to="HHE60424AE5533C1C52CCFDEB2BC0A76BF" order="1" />
    <link:loc xlink:type="locator" xlink:href="#HH74EA1208BE85CA3897CF6A5B735393D1" xlink:label="HH74EA1208BE85CA3897CF6A5B735393D1" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="HHEFA48F0614059F6A023B12846F00A941" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <p>
          <img title="4.gif" src="data:image/gif;base64," alt="" width="681" height="310" />
        </p>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" xlink:from="HH74EA1208BE85CA3897CF6A5B735393D1" xlink:to="HHEFA48F0614059F6A023B12846F00A941" order="1" />
    <link:loc xlink:type="locator" xlink:href="#HHB70FDD91B1C2BBB59230D1D1D9D52CC3" xlink:label="HHB70FDD91B1C2BBB59230D1D1D9D52CC3" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="HHFC0CB2A5EB0A403356EFE0D0BC4B710C" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <p>
          <strong>Schedule Page: 521 Line No.: 7 Column: e </strong>
        </p>
        <p>The allocation is derived from the throughput volume of each contract within the billing system. A path to path calculation of the rate utilized within the contract billing is determined and a percentage for recourse rate, discount rate and negotiated rate is derived based on the rate charged within the paths. This footnote also applies to column (e), lines 14, 22, 30, 37, 51 and 65.</p>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" xlink:from="HHB70FDD91B1C2BBB59230D1D1D9D52CC3" xlink:to="HHFC0CB2A5EB0A403356EFE0D0BC4B710C" order="1" />
    <link:loc xlink:type="locator" xlink:href="#HHE42A88354FE811940E49AF98CC4875FD" xlink:label="HHE42A88354FE811940E49AF98CC4875FD" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="HHFAB5C1EA1091095F2715BA25B588CFB2" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <p>
          <strong>Schedule Page: 521 Line No.: 7 Column: f </strong>
        </p>
        <p>The value of this gas is based on the current month spot rate. This footnote also applies to columns (g) and (h).</p>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" xlink:from="HHE42A88354FE811940E49AF98CC4875FD" xlink:to="HHFAB5C1EA1091095F2715BA25B588CFB2" order="1" />
    <link:loc xlink:type="locator" xlink:href="#HHC88398654C4B45477DA89A5E7E505041" xlink:label="HHC88398654C4B45477DA89A5E7E505041" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="HH72CA59C170D9FBE5B72FBA03AF2994BA" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <p>
          <strong>Schedule Page: 112 Line No.: 44 Column: d</strong>
        </p>
        <p>Reclassed Accumulated provision for rate refunds of $1,692,504, Account 229, line 31, column (d), to Interest accrued, Account 237, line 44, column (d), to conform with current year presentation.&#160;</p>
        <p>This footnote also applies to line 31, column (d).&#160;</p>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" xlink:from="HHC88398654C4B45477DA89A5E7E505041" xlink:to="HH72CA59C170D9FBE5B72FBA03AF2994BA" order="1" />
  </link:footnoteLink>
